{"html_text": {"ja377:0.1": "<article id='ja377'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja377:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja377:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja377:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja377:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja377:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja377:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja377:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja377:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja377:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja377:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja377:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja377:3.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja377:3.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja377:3.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja377:3.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja377:4.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja377:4.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja377:4.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja377:4.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja377:5.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja377:5.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja377:5.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja377:5.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja377:6.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja377:6.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja377:6.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja377:6.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja377:7.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja377:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja377:0.2": "Chakkanipāta ", "ja377:0.3": "Avāriyavagga ", "ja377:0.4": "2. Setaketujātaka ", "ja377:1.1": "“Mā tāta kujjhi na hi sādhu kodho, ", "ja377:1.2": "Bahumpi te adiṭṭhamassutañca; ", "ja377:1.3": "Mātā pitā disatā setaketu, ", "ja377:1.4": "Ācariyamāhu disataṁ pasatthā. ", "ja377:2.1": "Agārino annadapānavatthadā, ", "ja377:2.2": "Avhāyikā tampi disaṁ vadanti; ", "ja377:2.3": "Esā disā paramā setaketu, ", "ja377:2.4": "Yaṁ patvā dukkhī sukhino bhavanti”. ", "ja377:3.1": "“Kharājinā jaṭilā paṅkadantā, ", "ja377:3.2": "Dummakkharūpā yeme jappanti mante; ", "ja377:3.3": "Kacci nu te mānusake payoge, ", "ja377:3.4": "Idaṁ vidū parimuttā apāyā”. ", "ja377:4.1": "“Pāpāni kammāni katvāna rāja, ", "ja377:4.2": "Bahussuto ce na careyya dhammaṁ; ", "ja377:4.3": "Sahassavedopi na taṁ paṭicca, ", "ja377:4.4": "Dukkhā pamucce caraṇaṁ apatvā”. ", "ja377:5.1": "“Sahassavedopi na taṁ paṭicca, ", "ja377:5.2": "Dukkhā pamucce caraṇaṁ apatvā; ", "ja377:5.3": "Maññāmi vedā aphalā bhavanti, ", "ja377:5.4": "Sasaṁyamaṁ caraṇameva saccaṁ”. ", "ja377:6.1": "“Na heva vedā aphalā bhavanti, ", "ja377:6.2": "Sasaṁyamaṁ caraṇameva saccaṁ; ", "ja377:6.3": "Kittiñhi pappoti adhicca vede, ", "ja377:6.4": "Santiṁ puṇeti caraṇena danto”ti. ", "ja377:7.1": "Setaketujātakaṁ dutiyaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja377:0.1": "", "ja377:0.2": "", "ja377:0.3": "", "ja377:0.4": "", "ja377:1.1": "", "ja377:1.2": "", "ja377:1.3": "disatā → disā tāta (sya1ed, sya2ed); disā tā (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja377:1.4": "", "ja377:2.1": "annadapānavatthadā → annadapāṇavatthadā (bj); annapānavatthadā (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja377:2.2": "", "ja377:2.3": "", "ja377:2.4": "", "ja377:3.1": "", "ja377:3.2": "Dummakkharūpā → dumukkharūpā (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed); dummukkharūpā (pts-vp-pli1, mr) ", "ja377:3.3": "", "ja377:3.4": "", "ja377:4.1": "", "ja377:4.2": "Bahussuto ce na → bahussuto neva (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja377:4.3": "", "ja377:4.4": "", "ja377:5.1": "", "ja377:5.2": "", "ja377:5.3": "", "ja377:5.4": "caraṇameva → caraṇaññeva (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja377:6.1": "", "ja377:6.2": "", "ja377:6.3": "", "ja377:6.4": "Santiṁ puṇeti → santaṁ puno'ti (bj); santiṁ puneti (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja377:7.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja377:0.1": "", "ja377:0.2": "", "ja377:0.3": "", "ja377:0.4": "", "ja377:1.1": "dr27.187, ms22J_1326, msdiv8, pts-vp-pli3.233, pts-vp-pli3.234, sya27.188", "ja377:1.2": "", "